0138: ## 8. Behavior
0139: ### 8.1 Search actions
0140: - WHEN the user clicks Search (`nextButton`) THE SYSTEM SHALL clear general messages, hide summary errors, apply Kendo grid filters from the current field values, hide `#divFileBaseSourceStatus`, and show `#searchFileTransferConfigResultsPanel`. [ctl:nextButton, js:Scripts/FileTransfer/hp.ua3.FileTransfer.searchSourceLocations__884a35a7.js#performFileTransferSearch]
0141: - WHEN the user clicks Reset (`resetButton`) THE SYSTEM SHALL hide summary errors, reset field validations, reset the form fields to their defaults, clear grid data, uncheck Show Inactives, hide `#divFileBaseSourceStatus`, and hide `#searchFileTransferConfigResultsPanel`. [ctl:resetButton, js:Scripts/FileTransfer/hp.ua3.FileTransfer.searchSourceLocations__884a35a7.js#resetSearchFileTransfer]
0142: - WHEN the user toggles Show Inactives (`FileTransferShowInactiveCheckBox`) THE SYSTEM SHALL clear general messages and re-apply the grid filter using the current criteria values. [ctl:FileTransferShowInactiveCheckBox, js:Scripts/FileTransfer/hp.ua3.FileTransfer.searchSourceLocations__884a35a7.js#applyFileTransferFilter]
0143: 
0144: ### 8.2 Results grid
0145: - THE SYSTEM SHALL present a grid with a toolbar containing a “Show Inactives” checkbox and label. [kit:k4]
0146: - THE SYSTEM SHALL show the grid columns (in order): Configuration ID, Configuration Name, Protocol, Address, Mask, Owner Name, Owner Module, Status; and SHALL keep “Fts Source Location Id” hidden. [kit:k4]
0147: - THE SYSTEM SHALL page results with page size 10 and provide pager controls including refresh and page size options 5/10/20. [kit:k4]
0148: 
0149: ### 8.3 Create/view overlays
0150: - WHEN the user clicks “Create New” (`FileTransferGridAddButton`) THE SYSTEM SHALL open a modal overlay “FileTransferConfigurationEditPopup” loading `/FileTransfer/FileTransferConfigurationEdit/`. Dialog contents and save/cancel behavior are not captured. [ctl:FileTransferGridAddButton, js:inline-19.js, UNKNOWN: dialog content]
0151: - WHEN a grid row is selected and the view action is invoked (trigger not captured) THE SYSTEM SHALL open a modal overlay “FileTransferConfigurationViewOverlay” loading `/FileTransfer/FileTransferConfigurationView/?ftsSourceLocationId=<selected>`. [UNKNOWN: what user action invokes onDisplayFileTransferView (row double-click? view icon?)], [js:inline-19.js, js:Scripts/FileTransfer/hp.ua3.FileTransfer.searchSourceLocations__884a35a7.js#onDisplayFileTransferView]
