- [kit:k3] ProtocolList (dropdown, placeholder "select a value...", 4 options: FTP | SFTP | UNC | FTPS, help "Protocol")
- [kit:k4] grid: Configuration ID (sortable), Configuration Name (sortable), Protocol, Address (sortable), Mask (sortable), Owner Name (sortable), Owner Module (sortable), Status (sortable), Fts Source Location Id (sortable); page size 10
- field ConfigId: validation number "Configuration ID is restricted to numeric characters only [0-9]."; regex "Configuration ID is restricted to numeric characters only [0-9]."
- field ConfigName: validation regex "Configuration Name is restricted to alphanumeric characters only [A-Z], [a-z], [0-9]."
